  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">UPPSC Staff Nurse 2023 DV Schedule</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-30T12:26:51+05:30\">June 30, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">12:26 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://uppsc.up.nic.in/\">Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission (UPPSC)</a>, </strong>The <strong data-end=\"106\" data-start=\"90\">DV Schedule</strong> has been released on the official website for the recruitment of <strong data-end=\"201\" data-start=\"172\">Staff Nurse (Unani) Mains</strong>. This recruitment is for <strong data-end=\"246\" data-start=\"227\">2,240 positions</strong>. The application forms were filled from <strong data-end=\"332\" data-start=\"290\">August 21, 2023, to September 29, 2023</strong>. The <strong data-end=\"352\" data-start=\"338\">Mains Exam</strong> was conducted on <strong data-end=\"387\" data-start=\"370\">July 28, 2024</strong>. Candidates can check their <strong>DV Schedule</strong> using their <strong data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"439\">Enrollment Number / Registration Number / Date of Birth</strong> by logging into the portal provided below.</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n   